*.wbfs

# Game dumps and executables. Never commit these — they are the one thing that
# turns this repo from a toolchain into a distribution of someone's copyright.
# The list covers a disc image dropped anywhere, not just under NO_GitHub/.
*.wux
*.wud
*.wua
*.rpx
*.rpl
*.app
*.h3
*.tik
*.tmd
*.key

# Third-party tooling downloaded next to the tree (Ghidra loaders, JWUDTool).
*.zip
*.jar

NWii-documentation/

docs/
.*/
!.github/

# CMake
CMakeCache.txt
CMakeFiles
CMakeScripts
Testing
Makefile
cmake_install.cmake
install_manifest.txt
compile_commands.json
CTestTestfile.cmake
_deps/
log.txt

# Configuration files. Local scratch configs stay untracked, but the per-game
# profiles under configs/ are the source of truth for what each target is —
# they have to be committed.
*.toml
!configs/*.toml
*.csv
*.ini
*.log